07_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qb5D3Q0kankQ7kNvwF4QaJi&_nc_oc=AdqC1Yy_oQXOzT5r-HnK21AuwXJm-xxkEmXf9xaVoY2aVUkjF0M8Hx5ZntsM-tDnhzY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMLJSSiJEvZLgZIzXKrxZvNBgi2dZZ_YW0O1kxz_MWoNA&oe=6ADCBE42"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tbS9xAXravwQ7kNvwHy5-mS&_nc_oc=AdqJ6ke5Pua1Cbg4RSX4RfgQg5y0FXkyC-eS4PcYOPJWWQ_dYJs3zWm4y0XucysVCL4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMyi5V8PZOUQ9nKbasnLONh_UrAAD9i5H1e5Df35SmNAg&oe=6ADCB3BF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ppVGGMbB4kEQ7kNvwFklkQt&_nc_oc=AdrjfAGAGA6hSpyoXi922ToZbxHF5M-wvn9-pMxSfY2jBnZrju3VHzlt4eBn4HbSd3U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNSFX0-G6T6Fgca9ku-6VvQNWpHbU0d4iR1u8tfyJK3jw&oe=6ADCC2B0"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quic